    { level: 'olympiad', type: 'num', title: 'Meselson–Stahl', q: R`<p>Bacteria grown in ¹⁵N are moved to ¹⁴N. After 3 generations, what fraction of DNA molecules is hybrid (¹⁵N/¹⁴N)?</p>`, answer: 0.25, tol: 0.005, unit: '', hints: [R`2 hybrid molecules out of 2³.`], solution: R`<p>2/8 = 0.25; the rest are light.</p>` }
